{"title": "Bloody Favour (Condition)", "pageid": 46539, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Bloody_Favour_(Condition)", "categories": ["Conditions with shared stack IDs", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Generic Control Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Bloody Favour</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Bhaal's Chosen will be granted a profane boon at the start of every turn. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">LOW_BHAALTEMPLE_RITUALCHANNEL</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CLOW_BHAALTEMPLE_RITUALCHANNEL%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CLOW_BHAALTEMPLE_RITUALCHANNEL%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Conditions_with_the_same_stack_ID\"> Conditions with the same stack ID </span></h2>\nConditions with the <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">stack ID</a> <code>LOW_BHAALTEMPLE_RITUALCHANNEL</code>, only one of these can be applied at the same time:<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Bloody_Favour\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bloody_Favour_(Condition)\" title=\"Bloody Favour (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bloody Favour\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Bloody Favour</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Bhaal's Chosen will be granted a profane boon at the start of every turn.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Ritual_Chant:_Bhaal's_Power_Word_Kill\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ritual_Chant:_Bhaal%27s_Power_Word_Kill_(Condition)\" title=\"Ritual Chant: Bhaal's Power Word Kill (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6c/Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6c/Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6c/Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ritual Chant: Bhaal's Power Word Kill\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6c/Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6c/Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Ritual_Chant:_Bhaal%27s_Power_Word_Kill_(Condition)\" title=\"Ritual Chant: Bhaal's Power Word Kill (Condition)\">Ritual Chant: Bhaal's Power Word Kill</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>As part of the challenge to enter the temple, the <a href=\"/wiki/Ghislev\" title=\"Ghislev\">Farslayer</a> has begun chanting. It can cast <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bhaal%27s_Power_Word_Kill_Ritual\" title=\"Bhaal's Power Word Kill Ritual\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1e/Power_Word_Kill_Icon.webp/20px-Power_Word_Kill_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1e/Power_Word_Kill_Icon.webp/30px-Power_Word_Kill_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1e/Power_Word_Kill_Icon.webp/40px-Power_Word_Kill_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bhaal's Power Word Kill\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1e/Power_Word_Kill_Icon.webp/20px-Power_Word_Kill_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1e/Power_Word_Kill_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bhaal%27s_Power_Word_Kill_Ritual\" title=\"Bhaal's Power Word Kill Ritual\">Bhaal's Power Word Kill</a> once its profane ritual ends. Exiting the Farslayer's chanting range of 55 m (183 ft) makes its enemies invulnerable to the effect. Slaying the Farslayer stops the ritual and wins the conflict.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714220856\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.045 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.050 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1275/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 16137/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4029/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 18/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.022/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 981079/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   42.195      1 Template:Condition_page\n100.00%   42.195      1 -total\n 43.85%   18.502      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 15.12%    6.380      3 Template:Template_style\n 15.06%    6.353      2 Template:Condition_sources\n 14.71%    6.206      3 Template:Icon_link\n 14.53%    6.130     14 Template:Trim\n 13.68%    5.774      3 Template:Icon_text\n  9.36%    3.